error[E0443]: this parameter is `mut`: the call changes the place you pass
  --> tests/programs/functions/mut_params/e0443.la:8:10
  |
8 |     bump(x);
  |          ^
  |
  = help: write `mut x` for it, with `x` a `let mut` variable or a part of one

error[E0443]: this parameter isn't `out`, `ptr` or `mut`
  --> tests/programs/functions/mut_params/e0443.la:9:10
  |
9 |     show(mut x);
  |          ^^^^^
  |
  = help: `out` and `ptr` are only for an extern's parameters of that mode, `mut` for a `mut` parameter: pass the value itself

For more about E0443, run `lughac explain E0443`.
